    "bottom-right",
    "bottom",
    "bottom-left",
    "top-left",
    "middle",
    "decimal point"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Seven-segment displays are common anode: a segment is lit when its bit is 0.",
    "The manual lists a DP pin for every digit, but its Control Panel chapter says the dots are not enabled on the board. To be checked on real hardware."
